    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematic stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle, incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky buffs and drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/a8713ac8ae72de92248c5493144b29e3.avif?t=1749850482\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop Balls. Get Coins. Upgrade Everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlinkIdle is a cozy-chaotic idle game about bouncing balls, bucket luck, sparkly buffs, and chasing powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through pixel art stages of all different themes in this randomized idle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/ed7d881c0dd465239442b9eda8a2c210.poster.avif?t=1749850482\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/ed7d881c0dd465239442b9eda8a2c210.webm?t=1749850482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/a6317dd5c19c4675c6677d89d536ad64.avif?t=1749850482\" width=700 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting enough balls lets you go to a new stage, which offers a custom background, ball design, peg design, and audio experience. Relax with a rainy day or sizzle with a neon electric zap fest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/f53d4392b76ce02fec9b9afde919bafd.poster.avif?t=1749850482\" width=768 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/f53d4392b76ce02fec9b9afde919bafd.webm?t=1749850482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many stages in the base game, and even more that can be unlocked during later game stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/52242f4f22de3628801e452ad2df9034.avif?t=1749850482\" width=674 height=295 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As balls drop, coins are collected. These coins can be spent on various upgrades, such as increasing peg and ball rarity. The higher the rarity, the more coins you collect when pegs or buckets are struck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/dc725234b349981c70614efcd98a5a66.avif?t=1749850482\" width=586 height=65 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/a8713ac8ae72de92248c5493144b29e3.avif?t=1749850482\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop Balls. Get Coins. Upgrade Everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlinkIdle is a cozy-chaotic idle game about bouncing balls, bucket luck, sparkly buffs, and chasing powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through pixel art stages of all different themes in this randomized idle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/ed7d881c0dd465239442b9eda8a2c210.poster.avif?t=1749850482\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/ed7d881c0dd465239442b9eda8a2c210.webm?t=1749850482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/a6317dd5c19c4675c6677d89d536ad64.avif?t=1749850482\" width=700 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting enough balls lets you go to a new stage, which offers a custom background, ball design, peg design, and audio experience. Relax with a rainy day or sizzle with a neon electric zap fest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/f53d4392b76ce02fec9b9afde919bafd.poster.avif?t=1749850482\" width=768 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/f53d4392b76ce02fec9b9afde919bafd.webm?t=1749850482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many stages in the base game, and even more that can be unlocked during later game stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/52242f4f22de3628801e452ad2df9034.avif?t=1749850482\" width=674 height=295 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As balls drop, coins are collected. These coins can be spent on various upgrades, such as increasing peg and ball rarity. The higher the rarity, the more coins you collect when pegs or buckets are struck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/dc725234b349981c70614efcd98a5a66.avif?t=1749850482\" width=586 height=65 /></span></p>",
